# Oracle study notes for Evan's installed Steam games (snapshot docs/oracle/games/_installed.json, 2026-10-22).
# Written in the cloud from public knowledge of each game, in our own words: no store text, art, audio or code.
# Columns: slug, appid, name, genres, summary, camera, core loop, ui and feel, information, art, audio, lesson,
# DNA axes (0-9: tempo, challenge, expression, structure, social, systems, chance, session length),
# information mix (0-9, sums to 10: diegetic, spatial, meta, overlay, none), HUD % of screen, confidence.
# `study_games.py` turns these rows into docs/oracle/games/<slug>.json.

